        "text_GDCCcY": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Young athletes are training harder and more often than ever. Year-round seasons. Long tournament weekends. Early mornings. Late practices. <br/></p><p>Their routines are becoming more demanding, and they’re paying attention to the routines of their parents and coaches around them, too. They see the hydration packet, the protein shake, the products used before and after a workout — and they want habits of their own.</p><p>That’s a good thing. It means the example is landing. But wanting in shouldn’t mean reaching for something built for someone twice their age.</p><p>FUTR isn’t here to compete with the products already out there. FUTR is here because young athletes deserve an option designed around them from the start.</p>",
            "text_bottom_spacing": 20
          }
        }
      },
